{"parse": {"title": "7TH-01", "pageid": 55145, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/6TH-24\" title=\"6TH-24\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">7TH-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/7TH-02\" title=\"7TH-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">7TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.AF.B9.E8.A7.92.E7.BA.BF.E4.B8.AD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"对角线中\">对角线中</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 对角线中</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Secret of the Diagonal</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>泡<span class=\"color-value\"></span>软<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>树<span class=\"color-value\"></span>枝<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>抑<span class=\"color-value\"></span>或<span class=\"color-value\"></span>超<span class=\"color-value\"></span>验<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>天<span class=\"color-value\"></span>国<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>她<span class=\"color-value\"></span>相<span class=\"color-value\"></span>信<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>切<span class=\"color-value\"></span>都<span class=\"color-value\"></span>可<span class=\"color-value\"></span>以<span class=\"color-value\"></span>被<span class=\"color-value\"></span>掌<span class=\"color-value\"></span>握<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10701</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-510901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-510901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-510901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……妈妈，我不明白。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_shatan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_shatan\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_shatan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_9_bg_shatan.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_shatan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_9_bg_shatan.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_shatan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_9_bg_shatan.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_shatan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-510901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-510901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-510901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>为什么大家都讨厌“无理数”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>站在沙滩上的女性回过身来，望向年幼的女孩儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77：</div><div>嗯……你也讨厌无理数吗，37？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>有一点儿……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37低下头，踢走了脚下一块不规则的石子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我可以数出3，我可以数出17，但是我永远无法数出0.01001000100001……更不用说拿它计算了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>这些无限不循环小数会让结果变得一团糟，整个式子的简洁和优雅都会被毁掉，我不喜欢它们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77：</div><div>——但你最爱的图形圆，它的周长与直径之比也是个无理数，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>不，π是特殊的，我知道它是如何得来的，知道它代表的含义，我也能把它加入到计算中来。还有e，lg2，√2……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>可是，只有很少的无理数能像这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>那些完全无规律的、无法化简的、无限延伸的数字，我写不下它们，数不出它们，无法计算它们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>它们只是古怪地盘踞于数轴上，像神话里不可被神杀死的蛇足巨人癸干忒斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77：</div><div>……哈哈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……妈妈，你为什么要笑？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77：</div><div>笑你这么聪明，又这么笨，我的女儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77：</div><div>你只是还不够了解它们——而不是讨厌它们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那位修长的女性俯下身，拾起沙滩上的一根被海潮泡软的树枝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>柔软的树枝划过由沙子构成的集合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>四条等长的边，两条交错的对角线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个规整的方形。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-515712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-515712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-515712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">77：</div><div>来看看我们熟悉的老朋友吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-515701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-515701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-515701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">77：</div><div>√2，一个无理数，是纯粹算术上可得的结论，它等价于“在a和b都是整数的情况下，2不可能被表达成（a/b)²的形式。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-515701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-515701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-515701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">77：</div><div>我们不需要任何关于无理数的知识，就可以使用归谬法证明这一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-515701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-515701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-515701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">77：</div><div>然而，我们却可以轻易地在正方形的对角线上看到这个不可数的数字。这意味着——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-510910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-510910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-510910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>——我知道！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>这意味着，毕达哥拉斯以整数比为基石构建的数论是不牢靠的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77：</div><div>是的。这是一个简明、优美的定理，也是古代数学最好的成就之一。许多数正是不可通约的，而√2只是其中最显眼的一个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77：</div><div>它的发现摧毁了由整数比搭建的古典王国，也催生了使数学分析转向现代的突破性革命，揭开了更深邃的新一页。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77：</div><div>它向我们证明了，在我们脚下除去由尺规丈量的坚实大地之外，还有一个捉摸不透的神秘王国。它不可度量，不可通约，不可穷尽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77：</div><div>——而开启这个王国的钥匙，就光明正大地潜藏在正方形的对角线中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>无……理的王国？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩入迷地点点头，一如既往，她理解得很迅速。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我明白了，妈妈，永远都有超出我们认知之外的数字……这就是无理数的意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>所以……只要增进对它的了解，我们也一定能和无理数成为朋友！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>——可是，你还没有回答我，岛上的人们为什么都讨厌它？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看不清母亲的面容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只是记得回忆的最后，她嘴角的弧度柔和，神情平静——近乎怜悯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/HeadIconSmall-510911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/HeadIconSmall-510911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/HeadIconSmall-510911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……妈妈？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508317.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-508317.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508317.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508317.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-508317.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508317.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-508317.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508317.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_daoyukefang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_daoyukefang\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_daoyukefang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-1_7_bg_daoyukefang.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_daoyukefang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-1_7_bg_daoyukefang.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_daoyukefang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-1_7_bg_daoyukefang.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_daoyukefang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508317.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-508317.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508317.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508317.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-508317.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508317.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-508317.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508317.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>37……你醒来了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>床榻上的女孩突然坐了起来，双眼直直地向空气中望去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306618.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-306618.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306618.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306618.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-306618.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306618.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-306618.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306618.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>现在是什么时间，苏菲亚？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>你昏迷了一个星期，这段时间……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>友人的话语被打断了。37仓促地掀开被子，向挂着布帘的门洞跑去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>等一下，37，你还没有完全康复——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>不，已经没有时间了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我得去找6……我得快一点，快点去告诉大家——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>——我们的“圆”破碎了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "7TH-01"}}